The second quest
The second quest is a combination between a challenge and a battle. After you receive your second quest from story mode, go to crystal city and find the unseelers base.
As soon as you enter, you'll realize that you can only move towards right, not to front. The trick is to move one step in the right, then try to move in front. Keep doing this as long as you cannot find the way. when you find your way, it will be a short path, which will make you walk only five to six steps in the front and then will be blocked. Take those steps, then once again start to move one step right until you find your way in front. Keep doing this until you reach the end. Keep in mind that on your way you may find fire tiles, bombs, as well as teleporters which can move you to the very beginning of the map, so be careful.
When you reach the end, heal your health, then press shift enter. 
When you press shift enter, you'll be moved to the inside of the base. Beware that you will have to clime five floors while fighting for your life. After entering, move towards the stairs while killing different enemies. Climb the stairs, then enter the second floor. Keep doing this until you reach the last floor. The last floor is a little different. Here you can only move ahead if you kill the unseelers general. After you kill him move ahead to complete the quest.